      <title>程序员职场瓶颈根源：技术之外的底层思考力修炼</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260905/%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%E8%81%8C%E5%9C%BA%E7%93%B6%E9%A2%88%E6%A0%B9%E6%BA%90%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%95%E5%B1%82%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83%E5%8A%9B%E4%BF%AE%E7%82%BC/</link>
